#
#   auto_scroll_handler - Web::AutoScrollHandler: scrolling a container while a mouse selection
#   is dragged past its edges, and Web::MiddleButtonScrollHandler: middle-button autoscroll
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Page/AutoScrollHandler.cpp (lines 1-215) and
#       MiddleButtonScrollHandler.cpp (lines 1-94), with the inline functions of their headers.
#       MiddleButtonScrollHandler's destructor (an OwnPtr releasing it) is
#       middle_button_scroll_handler_destruct, which EventHandler calls where it releases one.
